  "difficulty_reason": "The scheme need not be Noetherian, separated or carry an ample line bundle. The proof constructs a global perfect lift of a local generator, adjoins a closed-support Koszul object, and uses a finite-affine induction with unbounded orthogonality to detect all quasi-coherent derived objects. Complete affine stable-perfect extension, map lifting and derived gluing supply the substantial global construction.",
